WEBVTT

00:00:00.697 --> 00:00:02.659
Two thousand years ago
somebody sat down and

00:00:02.659 --> 00:00:04.398
wrote a complete map of
the human mind.

00:00:04.398 --> 00:00:05.691
Thirteen words for its
parts.

00:00:05.691 --> 00:00:07.163
Not one of them is the word
mind.

00:00:07.163 --> 00:00:09.304
And the brain is not on the
map anywhere at all.

00:00:10.616 --> 00:00:11.869
In every method of the
needle,

00:00:11.869 --> 00:00:13.664
one must first take the
spirit as the root.

00:00:13.664 --> 00:00:15.501
So I am told. Then tell me
what a spirit is.

00:00:15.501 --> 00:00:17.046
Tell me what a will is and
a thought,

00:00:17.046 --> 00:00:19.092
because nobody in this
court has ever defined one

00:00:19.092 --> 00:00:19.384
for me.

00:00:20.223 --> 00:00:21.369
I will build them in order,

00:00:21.369 --> 00:00:23.153
and the order is the point
of the chapter.

00:00:23.153 --> 00:00:25.149
That which brings forth
life is called essence.

00:00:25.149 --> 00:00:26.593
When two essences strike
together,

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:27.782
that is what we call spirit.

00:00:27.782 --> 00:00:29.778
What comes and goes with
the spirit is the hun.

00:00:30.248 --> 00:00:32.482
Spirit is not a substance
there. It is a collision.

00:00:32.482 --> 00:00:34.759
And the list goes on for ten
more terms without once

00:00:34.759 --> 00:00:36.117
naming an organ above the
neck,

00:00:36.117 --> 00:00:38.438
because in this chapter the
mind is kept in the liver

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:39.752
and the lungs and the
kidneys.

00:00:40.488 --> 00:00:41.354
I came to catch him out,

00:00:41.354 --> 00:00:42.654
and here is what I
expected to find.

00:00:42.654 --> 00:00:43.484
Old words for the soul,

00:00:43.484 --> 00:00:44.964
piled up by somebody who
liked the sound.

00:00:44.964 --> 00:00:45.866
That is not what this is.

00:00:45.866 --> 00:00:47.418
Every term is built from the
one before it,

00:00:47.418 --> 00:00:49.223
and you cannot pull one
out without the rest of it

00:00:49.223 --> 00:00:49.512
falling.

00:00:50.066 --> 00:00:50.778
And at the end,

00:00:50.778 --> 00:00:52.818
the manual does something
manuals never do.

00:00:52.818 --> 00:00:55.095
It says that when all five
of these are injured,

00:00:55.095 --> 00:00:56.708
the needle cannot treat it
at all.

00:00:56.708 --> 00:00:57.704
A book about needles,

00:00:57.704 --> 00:00:59.934
telling you exactly where
its own needle stops.

00:01:00.344 --> 00:01:02.961
A dramatized adaptation of
a classical philosophical

00:01:02.961 --> 00:01:04.220
text. Not medical advice.

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:06.988
The full episode builds all
thirteen of them one by one

00:01:06.988 --> 00:01:09.657
and asks what this ancient
map of the mind got right.
